The popular Norwegian TV series "Rondo" is now on the air with
its WWW pages at http://www.oslonett.no/rondo.html. Moreover, Rondo
will do an Internet coverage in each of 10 programs, starting
at February 3d, and invites people from all over the Internet to
send in greetings and answer a new question from the Rondo staff
each week. Rondo Internet T-shirts to all winners! Rondo has also
launched another "URL-Of-The-Week" contest and hope to get many
contributions here, pointers to the contest are found on the
home-page.

The Rondo team are especially interested in getting in touch with
foreigners of Norwegian ancestry, or just foreigners interested
in Norway and Norwegian affairs.

The Rondo effort is probably the first time ever a TV channel uses the
Internet to get in contact with the home-audience and other
group all over the world.

Your feedback will be greatly appreciated!


